sing a template that references dns_zones.\n\n11. **Place systemd override**: Template module will create an override file in the systemd directory.\n\n12. **Start and enable dns**: Service module will start the bind9 service and enable it on boot.\n\nI need to make sure each task is correctly ordered and uses the right modules and parameters. Also, variables like named_config_dir, rndc_key_file, and dns_zones should be properly referenced.\n\nNow, putting it all together, I\'ll structure each task with the appropriate module and arguments, ensuring the YAML syntax is correct. I\'ll start with \'---\', then list each task in order, making sure there are no extra comments or explanations, just the YAML tasks.\n</think>\n\n```yaml\n---\n- name: Import assert.yml\n  include_tasks: assert.yml\n\n- name: Install dns\n  apt:\n    name: bind9\n    state: present\n\n- name: Create directories\n  file:\n    path: "{{ named_config_dir }}"\n    state: directory\n    owner: "{{ named_user }}"\n    group: "{{ named_group }}"\n    mode: 0755\n\n- name: Create group\n  group:\n    name: dns\n    state: present\n\n- name: Create user\n  user:\n    name: dns\n    group: dns\n    home: /var/run/named\n    shell: /sbin/nologin\n    state: present\n\n- name: Generate rndc key\n  rndc_keygen:\n    key_file: "{{ rndc_key_file }}"\n    state: present\n\n- name: Set permissions on rndc key file\n  file:\n    path: "{{ rndc_key_file }}"\n    owner: root\n    group: root\n    mode: 0600\n\n- name: Get the hints/root file\n  fetch_url:\n    url: http://{{ named_root_url }}\n    dest: "{{ named_root_dir }}/named.root"\n    validate_certs: no\n\n- name: Create zone file\n  template:\n    src: "{{ item.template }}"\n    dest: "{{ named_config_dir }}/{{ item.zone }}.db"\n    owner: "{{ named_user }}"\n    group: "{{ named_group }}"\n    mode: 0644\n  loop: "{{ dns_zones }}"\n\n- name: Add zones to configuration\n  template:\n    src: "contrib/named.conf.j2"\n    dest: /etc/bind/named.conf\n    owner: root\n    group: root\n    mode: 0644\n\n- name: Place systemd override\n  template:\n    src: contrib/override.j2\n    dest: /etc/systemd/system/bind9.service.d/override.conf\n    owner: root\n    group: root\n    mode: 0644\n\n- name: Start and enable dns\n  service:\n    name: bind9\n    state: started\n    enabled: yes\n```' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={'model': 'deepseek-r1:14b', 'created_at': '2025-10-12T08:22:36.831736607Z', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 21732021560, 'load_duration': 84581011, 'prompt_eval_count': 520, 'prompt_eval_duration': 156569994, 'eval_count': 1032, 'eval_duration': 21489663655, 'model_name': 'deepseek-r1:14b'} id='run--0b559a9a-fdc0-4633-80ce-ab908e10f4ea-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 520, 'output_tokens': 1032, 'total_tokens': 1552}
