content='<think>\nOkay, I need to fix the Ansible Playbook so that it passes ansible-lint. Let\'s see the errors.\n\nFirst, the playbook uses the shell module to get the Python version. Ansible-lint is complaining because it prefers using command over shell unless shell functionality is needed. So, I should replace ansible.builtin.shell with ansible.builtin.command.\n\nNext, the task "debian12 | Get python3 version installed" uses shell and registers the output. Since command doesn\'t return the same structure, I need to adjust how I capture the version. With command, the output is in cmd.stdout, so I\'ll set register to capture that.\n\nAlso, the error mentions \'no-changed-when\'. This means the task might not change anything, so I should add \'changed_when: false\' to prevent it from being marked as changed unnecessarily.\n\nLooking at the tasks, Task 1 and Task 3 are almost identical. They both remove the same file under the same conditions. I should remove the duplicate Task 3 to avoid redundancy.\n\nSo, the plan is:\n1. Replace shell with command in Task 2.\n2. Adjust the registration of the output.\n3. Add changed_when: false to Task 2.\n4. Remove the duplicate Task 3.\n\nNow, I\'ll structure the corrected playbook accordingly.\n</think>\n\n```yaml\n---\n- name: Remove EXTERNALLY-MANAGED file if we\'re on Debian12\n  ansible.builtin.file:\n    path: /usr/lib/python3.11/site-packagesEXTERNALLY-MANAGED\n    state: absent\n  when:\n    - ansible.os_family == "Debian"\n    - ansible_python_version == "3.11"\n\n- name: debian12 | Get python3 version installed\n  ansible.builtin.command:\n    cmd: python3 --version\n    register: python_version\n    changed_when: false\n  when: ansible.os_family == "Debian"\n\n- name: debian12 | Remove EXTERNALLY-MANAGED\n  ansible.builtin.file:\n    path: /usr/lib/python3.11/site-packagesEXTERNALLY-MANAGED\n    state: absent\n  when:\n    - ansible.os_family == "Debian"\n    - ansible_python_version == "3.11"\n```' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={'model': 'deepseek-r1:14b', 'created_at': '2025-10-12T09:10:20.027199272Z', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 10341999797, 'load_duration': 109643995, 'prompt_eval_count': 1479, 'prompt_eval_duration': 785533490, 'eval_count': 474, 'eval_duration': 9446033563, 'model_name': 'deepseek-r1:14b'} id='run--040a754d-e7b0-4dc9-8cd9-65747ad7b4fa-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 1479, 'output_tokens': 474, 'total_tokens': 1953}
