 files in that directory. \n\nPutting it all together, I'll update both tasks to use the FQCN modules and set the necessary permissions. I'll make sure not to change anything else, like task names or order, to adhere to the requirements.\n\nSo, the corrected playbook will have both tasks updated with the proper module names and permissions set. I'll structure the YAML correctly, ensuring each task has the necessary parameters and that the syntax is valid.\n</think>\n\n```yaml\n---\n- name: Create the RKE2 manifests directory\n  ansible.builtin.file:\n    path: /etc/rke2/manifests\n    state: directory\n    owner: root\n    group: root\n    mode: 0755\n\n- name: Copy ingress-nginx files to first server\n  ansible.builtin.copy:\n    remote_src: true\n    dest: /etc/rke2/manifests\n    src: ingress-nginx/*\n```" additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={'model': 'deepseek-r1:14b', 'created_at': '2025-10-12T10:45:52.627031564Z', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 10321790269, 'load_duration': 80912194, 'prompt_eval_count': 1568, 'prompt_eval_duration': 715688734, 'eval_count': 661, 'eval_duration': 9523501989, 'model_name': 'deepseek-r1:14b'} id='run--7a619e4a-4170-4a82-8998-ac4cceece991-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 1568, 'output_tokens': 661, 'total_tokens': 2229}
